motionally charged language ('Bribery Plot', 'Netting Clintons Millions') to frame the story in a maximally damaging way."}, {"text": "both his reputation and liberty" were "threatened" by the Obama administration in a effort to force his silence", "type": "Appeal_to_Fear-Prejudice", "reason": "Invokes fear of government overreach and authoritarian suppression to build alarm and outrage in the audience."}, {"text": "the Obama Justice Department threatened him with loss of freedom.

