rnalists' is a pejorative label designed to mock and delegitimize CNN reporters."}, {"text": "Russian Purchase of US Uranium Assets in Return for $145mm in Contributions to the Clinton Foundation", "type": "Causal_Oversimplification", "reason": "Presents the uranium deal as a straightforward transaction in exchange for donations, ignoring the multi-agency approval process and lack of proven quid pro quo."}, {"text": "a lot of bribery going on around the U.S.", "type": "Exaggeration,Minimisation", "reason": "The vague phrase 'a lot of bribery going on around the U.S.' exaggerates the scope of corruption without specific evidence."}, {"text": "This is wrong.

